Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||10-02-2000||11:00 PM||||Last year I saw someone with a custom auto shifter.. they took a manual shift knob and drilled a hole in the top. then a metal rod was dropped into the hole, to act as a button.. the metal rod was removed when the person got out of the car, so it acted as a security system as well..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>(hard to shift if you can't press the button.. hehe)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
